Task: Update backend/council.py to handle exceptions from individual model calls using asyncio.gather(..., return_exceptions=True).
Summary: Updated query_models_parallel in backend/openrouter.py to use return_exceptions=True. This ensures that a single model's failure doesn't cause the entire parallel batch to fail. Added handling to map exceptions to None, allowing the council to proceed with remaining successful models. Added tests for Stage 1 and Stage 2 resilience.
Files: backend/openrouter.py, tests/test_council_resilience.py
